# Binaries
doppel
doppel.exe
*.exe
*.test

dist/

# Laid by Claude Code when it loads the plugin's mod from a folder
# (--plugin-dir): it extends plugin/.claude-plugin/types/, which is per-build
# and ignores itself, so this file is meaningless in a fresh clone.
plugin/tsconfig.json

# Generated output
report.md
doppel-report.md
# The Pages site, assembled by .github/workflows/pages.yml. Underscore-prefixed
# so doppel's own walker skips it — see parser.ShouldSkipDir.
_site/

# Go test/coverage artifacts
coverage.out
coverage.html
*.coverprofile

# Vendor directory (if used)
vendor/
# ...except the dashboard's, which is design-system and third-party assets the
# page inlines, not Go modules. The Go rule above matches a directory named
# "vendor" at any depth, so without this the README recording each asset's
# source and licence is silently uncommittable — and broadsheet.css only
# survives because it was moved as a tracked rename.
!internal/dashboard/assets/vendor/

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/

# Claude Code
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
